    "doi": "10.1016/j.celrep.2026.117899",
    "title": "Diverse routes to Cas3 activation in type I CRISPR-Cas immunity."
  },
  "content": {
    "abstract": "Jiang et al. show that the type I-A CRISPR system of Saccharolobus islandicus recruits Cas3 only after target recognition. Their study reveals different Cas3 activation mechanisms and a dual role of ATP in target degradation and collateral cleavage.",
